ew cast of foes in every land, confront the powerful leader of each zverkin army, and find a way to end this senseless bloodshed as quickly as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d4ed556055ab043f354321e64135ff06.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d4ed556055ab043f354321e64135ff06.webm?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d4ed556055ab043f354321e64135ff06.mp4?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Can you survive long enough to bring peace back to your world and uncover what machinations led to this organized onslaught against all the towns of human kind?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/946a70c64fcbda828085b6bebf414267.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=103 /></span><br><br>Hone and test your skills as the deceptively agile Elrik Eisenfaust. While you can always count on your basic move set for fast evasion and powerful physical attacks, you must also learn to utilize the incredible power of your magic gauntlet, DaemonClaw, which takes on a new form in each land, giving you new magical abilities best suited to vanquish the new foes you face.<br><br>Experienced players can discover and master the nuanced elements to the combat. For example, there are many ways to deal with the boomerang blades thrown by the Adleraki (bird-people) of level 1:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c128c623447e47f07b2dc571ef8bc861.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c128c623447e47f07b2dc571ef8bc861.webm?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c128c623447e47f07b2dc571ef8bc861.mp4?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>While taking place in a epic fantasy world, the intriguing plot unfolds fluidly during the action and level transitions. Like the classic arcade style games of the past, DaemonClaw is intended to be an adrenalin fueled blast. There's no grinding for experience points or health potions in DaemonClaw and no back-tracking to find additional items. Bosses become easier to beat as you build your actual skill playing the game. DaemonClaw is a continual fast action push towards the goal of ending a sudden war and saving humanity. The goal of the game design of DaemonClaw is non-stop fun and great replay value as a result. The kind of game you'll want to play again even though you just beat it earlier that same day.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/e6dd7ddf48dddc42b7011f9d7d928e3b.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=103 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/f1f4121f1b3fc9e76254240ea116804d.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/f1f4121f1b3fc9e76254240ea116804d.gif?t=1758012628\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/bdd8e6a94f6aac53d030f4572db4a51d.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/bdd8e6a94f6aac53d030f4572db4a51d.apng?t=1758012628\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=188 /></picture></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c479b267733daad529b43343f217cd39.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=89 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/b74ade3705d5dc95b3ce0f24230f0130.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/b74ade3705d5dc95b3ce0f24230f0130.webm?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/b74ade3705d5dc95b3ce0f24230f0130.mp4?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/0f1de79e75e7133468d5be36f8eb2cc3.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/0f1de79e75e7133468d5be36f8eb2cc3.webm?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/0f1de79e75e7133468d5be36f8eb2cc3.mp4?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d1206d3e92ee1fbe57a2983f2b2b2b39.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d1206d3e92ee1fbe57a2983f2b2b2b39.webm?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d1206d3e92ee1fbe57a2983f2b2b2b39.mp4?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/95ef8e6fd2908c52fa36833413787526.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=103 /></span><br><br>These is the first two bosses you'll encounter in DaemonClaw. You'll have to face many others during your quest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/f7b820fcb62345c171782fa76b47fcc7.avif?t=1758012628\" width=616 height=191 /></span><br><br>While each level constantly keeps you on your toes with a never ending onslaught of basic enemies, the end of each level is where you'll face off with the most formidable leader of that land, and to make maters worse, they each control powerful magical artifacts, or, in some cases, maybe the artifact controls them...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/3861b85373277b06dbdd867f73d02f36.poster.avif?t=1758012628\" width=488 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/3861b85373277b06dbdd867f73d02f36.webm?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/3861b85373277b06dbdd867f73d02f36.mp4?t=1758012628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["BitBeamCannon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c